    "**Key Insights from Test Cases:**\n",
    "\n",
    "The test cases demonstrate:\n",
    "- **Real-world applicability**: Both models can predict car prices from specifications\n",
    "- **Prediction accuracy**: Error percentages show how close predictions are to actual prices\n",
    "- **Model comparison**: Direct comparison reveals which model performs better on specific cases\n",
